          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Let $R_1,R_2,R_3$ be the original rows, $\\det(R_1,R_2,R_3)=3$. New rows: $N_1=R_1+2R_3$, $N_2=3R_1-R_2$, $N_3=R_1$. By multilinearity, $\\det(N_1,N_2,N_3)=2\\det(R_3,N_2,R_1)$ (the $R_1$ part vanishes since $N_3=R_1$ repeats a row). $\\det(R_3,N_2,R_1)=\\det(R_3,3R_1-R_2,R_1)=-\\det(R_3,R_2,R_1)=-(-\\det(R_1,R_2,R_3))=3$. So the total is $2\\cdot3=6$, matching option F.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Gọi $R_1,R_2,R_3$ là các hàng gốc, $\\det(R_1,R_2,R_3)=3$. Hàng mới: $N_1=R_1+2R_3$, $N_2=3R_1-R_2$, $N_3=R_1$. Theo tính đa tuyến tính, $\\det(N_1,N_2,N_3)=2\\det(R_3,N_2,R_1)$ (phần $R_1$ triệt tiêu vì $N_3=R_1$ lặp lại một hàng). $\\det(R_3,N_2,R_1)=\\det(R_3,3R_1-R_2,R_1)=-\\det(R_3,R_2,R_1)=-(-\\det(R_1,R_2,R_3))=3$. Vậy tổng bằng $2\\cdot3=6$, khớp phương án F.</p></div>"
